#+name: package_fetches_chart
```chart line
title: Package fetches by day
x: day
y: fetches
source: package_fetches
```

* Local CSV query template

```dataset package_fetch_csv
type: csv
path: ./data/package-fetches.csv
engine: duckdb
```

```sql results=package_fetches_by_day freshness=24h
SELECT day, sum(fetches) AS fetches
FROM package_fetch_csv
GROUP BY day
ORDER BY day
```

* ClickHouse query template

```dataset package_fetch_warehouse
type: clickhouse
profile: scarf-clickhouse
query: |
  SELECT toDate(timestamp) AS day, count() AS fetches
  FROM package_downloads
  WHERE timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 30 DAY
  GROUP BY day
  ORDER BY day
```

* Metabase query template

```dataset package_fetch_question
type: metabase
profile: scarf-metabase
question: 123
parameters: |
  []
```
